    "designmd": "---\nname: Vector Utility\nversion: \"1\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4E79A7\"\n  surface: \"#151719\"\n  surface_raised: \"#202428\"\n  text: \"#F2F4F5\"\n  text_muted: \"#9AA3AA\"\n  accent: \"#E0B14F\"\ntypography:\n  body:\n    family: Inter\n    size: 12\nrounded:\n  panel: 12\nspacing:\n  unit: 8\n---\n# Vector Utility\nA compact, hero-less mastering utility panel with a clinical utility-grid structure, restrained contrast, and fast-scanning grouped controls for gain, pan, width, polarity, and output."
